's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"026121857b30b50debd0fb6c12e8c224","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"f37b295e11aebc26aa3f47c9b8559e3d","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"b50da2f5db256cfbfbfc473f110ff0b5","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"30992e7158306ea2a0e4be6fabf2e280","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"f354e25a1ec664d2562af9b12a13876f","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"6d0fc708d185980d502e45b60a12c925","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"2a8e48eb509191c53ca7cb735b6bf0d7","originalFileName":"b6f3f614-b80c-4afd-87d4-76d065fc74bf-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"f63f341b